[263.254582, "o", "Counter({800: 169, 600: 6, 400: 1})\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:52.156Z | evt-01741 | Code 600 | Image:  | Msg: Provider \"Registry\" is Started. \r\r\n\r\r\nDetails: \r\r\n\tProviderName=Registry\r\r\n\tNewProviderState=Started\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:52.158Z | evt-01744 | Code 600 | Image:  | Msg: Provider \"Alias\" is Started. \r\r\n\r\r\nDetails: \r\r\n\tProviderName=Alias\r\r\n\tNewProviderState=Started\r\r\n\r\r\n\tSeque\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:52.160Z | evt-01746 | Code 600 | Image:  | Msg: Provider \"Environment\" is Started. \r\r\n\r\r\nDetails: \r\r\n\tProviderName=Environment\r\r\n\tNewProviderState=Start\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:52.161Z | evt-01748 | Code 600 | Image:  | Msg: Provider \"FileSystem\" is Started. \r\r\n\r\r\nDetails: \r\r\n\tProviderName=FileSystem\r\r\n\tNewProviderState=Started\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:52.163Z | evt-01751 | Code 600 | Image:  | Msg: Provider \"Function\" is Started. \r\r\n\r\r\nDetails: \r\r\n\tProviderName=Function\r\r\n\tNewProviderState=Started\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:52.165Z | evt-01753 | Code 600 | Image:  | Msg: Provider \"Variable\" is Started. \r\r\n\r\r\nDetails: \r\r\n\tProviderName=Variable\r\r\n\tNewProviderState=Started\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:52.166Z | evt-01755 | Code 400 | Image:  | Msg: Engine state is changed from None to Available. \r\r\n\r\r\nDetails: \r\r\n\tNewEngineState=Available\r\r\n\tPreviousE\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:53.339Z | evt-02038 | Code 800 | Image:  | Msg: \r\n2026-05-06T00:00:53.393Z | evt-02122 | Code 800 | Image:  | Msg: \r\n2026-05-06T00:00:53.396Z | evt-02125 | Code 800 | Image:  | Msg: \r\n"]
