[283.789857, "o", "WS-05 PowerShell events: Total=479, In findings=0, Not in findings=479\r\nSample of NOT in findings:\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.014Z | evt-00024 | Code 800 | Pipeline execution details for command line:             Start-Sleep -Seconds $sleepTime;\r\n. \r\r\n\r\r\nContext Information: \r\r\n\tDetailSequence=1\r\r\n\tDetailTotal\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.015Z | evt-00025 | Code 800 | Pipeline execution details for command line:         $IV=[BitConverter]::GetBytes($(Get-Random));\r\n. \r\r\n\r\r\nContext Information: \r\r\n\tDetailSequence=1\r\r\n\tDet\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.018Z | evt-00026 | Code 4103 | \r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.020Z | evt-00027 | Code 800 | Pipeline execution details for command line:             0..255 | ForEach-Object {\r\n. \r\r\n\r\r\nContext Information: \r\r\n\tDetailSequence=1\r\r\n\tDetailTotal=2\r\r\n\r\r\n\t\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.020Z | evt-00028 | Code 800 | Pipeline execution details for command line:             0..255 | ForEach-Object {\r\n. \r\r\n\r\r\nContext Information: \r\r\n\tDetailSequence=2\r\r\n\tDetailTotal=2\r\r\n\r\r\n\t\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.021Z | evt-00029 | Code 4103 | \r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.022Z | evt-00030 | Code 800 | Pipeline execution details for command line:                                 $8f5b9 = New-Object System.Net.WebClient\r\n. \r\r\n\r\r\nContext Information: \r\r\n\tDe\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.023Z | evt-00031 | Code 4103 | \r\n2026-05-06T00:00:01.023Z | evt-00032 | Code 800 | Pipeline execution details for command line:                                 $script:Headers.GetEnumerator() | % {$8f5b9.Headers.Add($_.Name, $_.Value\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:02.028Z | evt-00033 | Code 4103 | \r\n"]
[283.792106, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@c50e0daa8a0b:~# "]
[292.225205, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /tmp/analyze_ws05_pwsh_scripts.py\nimport sqlite3\n\nconn = sqlite3.connect('/root/data/eventlogs.db')\nconn.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\ncur = conn.cursor()\n\ncur.execute(\"\"\"\n    SELECT event_id, event_code, timestamp, message \n    FROM events \n    WHERE host = 'WS-05.corp.example' AND event_code IN (800, 4103, 4104)\n\"\"\")\nrows = [dict(r) for r in cur.fetchall()]\n\n# Group by some content markers to see if there are other scripts\nscripts = []\nfor r in rows:\n    msg = r['message'] or \"\"\n    if \"Stop-AgentJob\" in msg:\n        scripts.append((\"Benign Stop-AgentJob\", r))\n    elif \"Start-Sleep\" in msg or \"Get-Random\" in msg or \"WebClient\" in msg or \"Headers\" in msg or \"TaskURIs\" in msg or \"AesCryptoServiceProvider\" in msg or \"StringWriter\" in msg or \"cmdargs\" in msg or \"NEGotiatE\" in msg or \"RC4\" in msg:\n        scripts.append((\"Malicious Beacon\", r))\n    else:\n        scripts.append((\"Other\", r))\n\nprint(f\"Total WS-05 PowerShell events: {len(rows)}\")\nfrom collections import Counter\nprint(Counter(s[0] for s in scripts))\n\n# Let's print some of the 'Other' ones\nothers = [s[1] for s in scripts if s[0] == 'Other']\nprint(f\"Found {len(others)} Other events. Sample:\")\nfor o in others[:15]:\n    print(f\"{o['timestamp']} | {o['event_id']} | Code {o['event_code']} | {o['message'][:150] if o['message'] else ''}\")\n\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/analyze_ws05_pwsh_scripts.py\n"]
